":"INFO NAM1","string":"こんな終わり方は……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000816|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お助けください、主たちよ……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000817|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"こんなところで終わるはずが……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000819|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うっ……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081A|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ぐあっ……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081B|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"主たちよ……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081C|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ありがとう……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081D|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"闇よ……ついに……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000824|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ぐああっ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000825|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うおおおっ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000826|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ぐるるるっ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000829|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"深く切り裂いてやる！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082A|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"貴様の骨を砕いてやる！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082B|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"屈するか、苦しむかだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082C|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ぐああっ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082D|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ぐおおっ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000830|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"我が主たちのために血を流せ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000831|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"へし折ってやる！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000832|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"今日がお前の命日だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000833