,{"form_id":"0x000860|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もっと近くへ……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000861|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"近づけば、主人様たちがお前の死を求める。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000862|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"邪魔をするな……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000863|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それ以上近づけば、それがお前の最後の行いになるぞ……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000865|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"腹が減った……早く食べ物をもらえるといいが。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000866|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そろそろ地上に戻らねば……やるべき仕事がある……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000867|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この闇にもっと多くの者が加わる。皆、感謝するだろう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000868|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"疲れ果てた……だが、主人様たちには私の汗を捧げる価値がある。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000869|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"闇が近づいてくる……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086A|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"私は無価値だ、私は無だ。闇こそが絶対だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086B|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ご慈悲に感謝します、主人様……","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086C|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この薄闇……美しい。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086D|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"輝ける栄光……感謝いたします、主人様。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086E|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"誰もが我らに加わる、この輝きの中で。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086F|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ファルメルに栄光あれ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000870|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"悪夢がますます強くなる……闇こそが私の救いだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000871|falmer servant lines expansion.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ドワーフどもがいなくなってせいせいした……最良の者でさえ裏切り者だった……",